<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>听评课记录</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'SimSun', 'STSong', serif;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .document-container {
            width: 780px;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 50px 60px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
            position: relative;
        }
        .header-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            margin-left: 12px; /* Compensate for letter-spacing offset */
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            border: 2px solid #000;
        }
        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            text-align: center;
            vertical-align: middle;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 8px 4px;
        }
        .text-left {
            text-align: left !important;
        }

        /* Handwriting Styles */
        .hw-black {
            font-family: 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi_GB2312', cursive;
            color: #111;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .hw-red {
            font-family: 'Kaiti', 'STKaiti', 'KaiTi_GB2312', cursive;
            color: #c0392b;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        /* Specific Layouts */
        .split-cell {
            padding: 0 !important;
            height: 100%;
        }
        .split-top {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 6px 0;
        }
        .split-bottom {
            padding: 6px 0;
        }

        /* Placeholder for Staples */
        .staple-placeholder {
            position: absolute;
            top: 65px;
            left: 55%;
            width: 65px;
            height: 38px;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #777, #777 2px, #999 2px, #999 4px);
            border: 1px solid #555;
            box-shadow: 2px 3px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
            transform: rotate(-2deg);
            z-index: 10;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 1px #000;
        }

        /* Main Body Alignment */
        .main-content-row td {
            vertical-align: top;
            padding: 20px 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .main-content-row .left-col div {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        /* Indentations for left column */
        .indent-0 { margin-left: 0; }
        .indent-1 { margin-left: 1.2em; }
        .indent-2 { margin-left: 2.5em; }
        .indent-3 { margin-left: 3.8em; }

        .wavy-underline {
            text-decoration: underline wavy #c0392b;
            text-underline-offset: 4px;
            text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="document-container">
        <!-- Staple Placeholder -->
        <div class="staple-placeholder">[Staples]</div>

        <div class="header-title">听评课记录</div>

        <table>
            <!-- Info Row 1 -->
            <tr>
                <td style="width: 8%;">科目</td>
                <td style="width: 14%;" class="hw-black">语文</td>
                <td style="width: 8%;">班级</td>
                <td style="width: 14%;" class="hw-black">二年级</td>
                <td style="width: 10%;">授课者</td>
                <td style="width: 16%;"></td> <!-- Covered by staples -->
                <td style="width: 8%;">时间</td>
                <td style="width: 22%;" class="hw-black">3.6</td>
            </tr>
            <!-- Info Row 2 -->
            <tr>
                <td>课题</td>
                <td colspan="3" class="text-left hw-black" style="padding-left: 20px; letter-spacing: 2px;">寻找春天</td>
                <td>授课类型</td>
                <td class="hw-black">公开课</td>
                <td>课时</td>
                <td class="split-cell">
                    <div class="split-top">共 <span style="display:inline-block; width: 25px;"></span> 课时</div>
                    <div class="split-bottom">第 <span style="display:inline-block; width: 25px;"></span> 课时</div>
                </td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Column Headers -->
            <tr style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px;">
                <td colspan="6" style="padding: 12px 0;">教学活动过程</td>
                <td colspan="2" style="padding: 12px 0; letter-spacing: 6px;">点评</td>
            </tr>

            <!-- Main Content Area -->
            <tr class="main-content-row">
                <!-- Left Column (Activities) -->
                <td colspan="6" class="text-left left-col hw-black">
                    <div class="indent-0">一、导入</div>
                    <div class="indent-1">1.春天在哪里？找出春天的变化？</div>
                    <div class="indent-1">2.出示有关春天的四字成语.</div>
                    <div class="indent-1">3.齐读课题《笋芽儿》《小池塘》</div>
                    <div class="indent-2">学生书空课题.</div>

                    <div class="indent-0">二、走进春天</div>
                    <div class="indent-1">自学导航一</div>
                    <div class="indent-1">1.自由朗读课文.</div>
                    <div class="indent-1">2.有哪些人物帮助了笋芽？请用“○”圈出来.</div>
                    <div class="indent-1"><span class="wavy-underline">3.他们分别做了什么？对笋芽儿说了什么？请用“~~”</span></div>
                    <div class="indent-0">把有关的句子画出来.</div>

                    <div class="indent-2">A.学生汇报（个别）</div>
                    <div class="indent-2">B.①师带生“读厚”.</div>
                    <div class="indent-3">②重音符号.</div>

                    <div class="indent-1">自学导航二</div>
                </td>

                <!-- Right Column (Comments) -->
                <td colspan="2" class="text-left hw-red" style="position: relative;">
                    <div style="margin-top: 1.8em; margin-left: 5px;">
                        提问的形<br>
                        式引导学生走进<br>
                        春天，说出春天<br>
                        的特征。
                    </div>
                    <div style="margin-top: 9em; margin-left: 5px;">
                        问题紧扣<br>
                        课文，学生能根<br>
                        据问题找出答<br>
                        案，突出重点。
                    </div>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
